OL,3,A'Come all the way' back to EU, French
OL,4,Afinance minister tells UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsked about the PM's comments, Lescure
OL,7,Ftold the BBC: "British people decided,
OL,8,Fand that's obviously their 100% right,
OL,9,Fand if they're willing to come back,
OL,10,Fthey will have to decide."
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
