OL,3,ABadenoch says Tories would scrap
OL,4,Ainheritance tax on family homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FBadenoch also used her speech to try to
OL,7,Fmake clear how the Tories differed to
OL,8,FLabour and Reform UK.
OL,10,FShe pitched them as the "no-nonsense
OL,11,Fparty" compared to the Reform UK
OL,12,F"circus" and accused Prime Minister
OL,13,FAndy Burnham of wanting to "live in the
OL,14,Fpast".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
