OL,3,ATexas carries out first US execution
OL,4,Asince Christa Pike's botched lethal
OL,5,Ainjections
OL,6,
OL,7,FA death row inmate was executed by
OL,8,Flethal injection on Wednesday evening
OL,9,Fin Texas, the first execution in the US
OL,10,Fsince the failed attempt to put Christa
OL,11,FPike to death last week.
OL,13,FLawyers for 46-year-old Jamaal Howard
OL,14,Fhad asked a judge to pause the
OL,15,Fexecution in light of Pike's botched
OL,16,Finjections last week, according to the
OL,17,FBBC's US partner, CBS News.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
