OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASpanish pensioner whose eviction
OL,4,Asparked nationwide protests dies, union
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe company that owned the flat later
OL,8,Foffered to allow her to return at a
OL,9,Flower rate - but she was unable to sign
OL,10,Fan agreement as she had been admitted
OL,11,Fto hospital.
OL,13,F"We regret to announce that Maricarmen
OL,14,Fpassed away today," the Madrid Tenants'
OL,15,FUnion said in a statement, adding her
OL,16,Fsituation marked "a turning point in
OL,17,Fthe history of this country".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
