OL,3,AFrance's school protests: what lies
OL,4,Abehind the anger
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince late September students across
OL,7,FFrance have been holding protests
OL,8,Fagainst underfunding in education, and
OL,9,Fhave been blocking access to many high
OL,10,Fschools.
OL,12,FThe movement has turned violent in
OL,13,Fplaces ` hundreds of students, teachers
OL,14,Fand police officers have been injured.
OL,15,FThousands of people ` including an
OL,16,Funknown number of outside troublemakers
OL,17,F` have been arrested.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
