OL,3,AFrance's school protests: what lies
OL,4,Abehind the anger
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe protesters are complaining about
OL,7,Fstaff shortages and dilapidated
OL,8,Ffacilities in the country's lycees,
OL,9,Fschools which are attended by
OL,10,F15-18-year-olds.
OL,12,F"Sometimes our teachers are absent for
OL,13,Fseveral weeks without being replaced,"
OL,14,FMadalena, a Paris student, told the BBC
OL,15,Fon Tuesday as demonstrations brought
OL,16,Fout hundreds of thousands across
OL,17,FFrance. Her school buildings, she
OL,18,Fadded, were "boiling hot" during the
OL,19,Frecent heat waves.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
